# level instead of copying the full-chain array and switching both.
# Position 18 on m17_park_x_copy; rule 4 against m17's peak table (75.4 GiB, 79,045,372 kB; zen4,
# 16-core cpuset, shared node, pmsample_chain; run m18r_copy_after_switch).
#
