#              28.2 GB  35.0%  all_layer_test() (test_full_scheme.hpp:1075)  <- seal::Ciphertext::operator=   (enc_ecd_x_copy at the full 35-limb chain: the copy taken BEFORE the mod switch)
#              28.2 GB  35.0%  batch_input (Batch_encode_encrypt.hpp:32)  <- seal::Encryptor::encrypt_internal   (enc_ecd_x, the encrypted input itself; live)
#              17.2 GB  21.3%  all_layer_test() (test_full_scheme.hpp:1000, attributed :1004)  <- keygenerator.h:208:create_galois_keys   (attention rotation keys, just created; live)
#               3.5 GB   4.3%  all_layer_test() (test_full_scheme.hpp:980)  <- context.h:496:seal::SEALContext::SEALContext
#               1.9 GB   2.4%  sealpool:retained
